    "title": "Bonmatí has chance to face Portugal despite recent meningitis - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Spain star Aitana Bonmatí has a chance of playing in the women's Euro 2025 game with Portugal on Thursday despite only just recovering from viral meningitis. The twice Ballon d'Or winner has trained and is \"so eager,\" coach Montse Tome told reporters on Wednesday. \"We have to hold her back a bit. Her health is the first and most important thing.\" However, an appearance in Bern as the world champions open their campaign has not been ruled out. \"Aitana is evolving positively,\" the coach added. \"She's willing to play, but we’ll see what the medical services are telling me.\"",
